{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two aspiring culinary geniuses open a traveling food truck and venture out to Khaya Island \u2013 a long abandoned, dangerous island with no shortage of monsters and mysteries. Together, the duo explore Khaya Island in search of new recipes and tastes while slowly uncovering the veil of secrets that haunts the locale.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2650730/extras/da54dc610c8a0a0decbf34b9fee1affc.webp?t=1756483538\" width=600 height=45 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2650730/extras/802a63574f3eeda221e4ee46717a0793.avif?t=1756483538\" width=600 height=90 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Forge</strong> your culinary adventure either solo, or with a friend! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore</strong> each level to obtain ingredients and prepare food orders, facing fearsome beasts and dangerous hazards along the way.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2650730/extras/e9f3b6478c8d33825031ed1de031c925.poster.avif?t=1756483538\" width=616 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2650730/extras/e9f3b6478c8d33825031ed1de031c925.webm?t=1756483538\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2650730/extras/e9f3b6478c8d33825031ed1de031c925.mp4?t=1756483538\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2650730/extras/4ab8fffa1e282f99a7091d94e0502fa7.avif?t=1756483538\" width=600 height=90 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Whip up</strong> dishes as <strong>Som</strong>, the Cooker, or <strong>battle</strong> fearsome creatures while foraging for ingredients as <strong>Gon</strong>, the Hunter. It\u2019ll take your combined effort to keep your business up and running!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2650730/extras/758d2d352752093070d5749fe4d0716f.poster.avif?t=1756483538\" width=616 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2650730/extras/758d2d352752093070d5749fe4d0716f.webm?t=1756483538\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2650730/extras/758d2d352752093070d5749fe4d0716f.mp4?t=1756483538\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2650730/extras/6f9dfb2655bf8f989de581e517ff946d.avif?t=1756483538\" width=600 height=90 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Venture</strong> through a rich and unique Southeast Asian-inspired fantasy world, hone your culinary skills and unearth the mysteries of Khaya Island. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The island boasts a variety of vastly different biomes, each with their own food, cooking methods and unique wildlife for players to enjoy.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2650730/extras/1913750ecbfc107ebf3de9b655b5872e.poster.avif?t=1756483538\" width=800 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2650730/extras/1913750ecbfc107ebf3de9b655b5872e.webm?t=1756483538\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2650730/extras/1913750ecbfc107ebf3de9b655b5872e.mp4?t=1756483538\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2650730/extras/830f01990827ee5fbf2d86b36d5b6d32.avif?t=1756483538\" width=600 height=90 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Prepare</strong> a wide range of popular dishes enjoyed in Southeast Asia, such as pineapple fried rice, chicken rice, banh mi and even bubble tea! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fill up the <strong>Makanomicon</strong> as you discover and master cooking each dish -- there\u2019s a ton of dishes waiting to be served up in each level.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2650730/extras/96a200b9d6ca47dd8897267eeb29fe1b.poster.avif?t=1756483538\" width=616 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2650730/extras/96a200b9d6ca47dd8897267eeb29fe1b.webm?t=1756483538\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2650730/extras/96a200b9d6ca47dd8897267eeb29fe1b.mp4?t=1756483538\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2650730/extras/81921345c042727b474eafb752e45dc9.avif?t=1756483538\" width=600 height=90 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Equip</strong> yourself with Charms, Weapons and Utensils as you face the challenges that lie ahead in Khaya Island.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2650730/extras/2ce9fe4f11de62367edca292c0c688af.poster.avif?t=1756483538\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2650730/extras/2ce9fe4f11de62367edca292c0c688af.webm?t=1756483538\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2650730/extras/2ce9fe4f11de62367edca292c0c688af.mp4?t=1756483538\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Bagus!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2650730/103f7b444d32425220c38d2deaaac0e117b1ec20.jpg"},{"name":"T\u014fu!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2650730/059cff36c13244e36a127a12637c9fdf54ba860b.jpg"},{"name":"Mantap!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2650730/0df10b8308b0fddad264a495bc26885b714d92d4.jpg"},{"name":"Aesb!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2650730/73e88bc2099bd552531a7cdf9ede3905277216de.jpg"},{"name":"Jom!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2650730/a0ad70d78d1bf4dfb4c72a8fc26baabd6ac2b35c.jpg"},{"name":"Thwa Meh!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2650730/c266e8df31c5f31189b00a342fb3b46c4b55634f.jpg"},{"name":"Tara!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2650730/a155049328a260d40ae16dcfce8be02c79ccd820.jpg"},{"name":"Steady!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2650730/6bad68371544f38720c46fe5c1a026d4ee23f4ab.jpg"},{"name":"Pai!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2650730/23312e816a53fa60f2b8c5aa7ce8aca803db8437.jpg"},{"name":"B\u00e1!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2650730/516d07c1c532fe6eb25d027a7578d6e869094a44.jpg"}],"total":60},"background":"https://store.aka